{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/543a3eaca94bc835e65e443a5397ea06.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=139 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/cf91eccaf9b2e99ad25fe41260d13f3e.poster.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/cf91eccaf9b2e99ad25fe41260d13f3e.webm?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/cf91eccaf9b2e99ad25fe41260d13f3e.mp4?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Guardian, an in-development title, is a captivating side-scrolling action shooter where players embody Kita, a young warrior guardian on a besieged Space Station kingdom of Alterra . Charged with safeguarding a prince from subversive cybermagi wielding abilities akin to magic, players employ action shooting, stealth, and hacking to triumph over foes and escape as the entire station becomes your foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Engage in adrenaline-pumping battles requiring both strategy and quick reflexes. Choose from an array of high-tech or present-day weapons and double- upgrade them to unleash devastating firepower.  Alternatively, wield a trusty melee sword for up-close combat, slashing through enemies with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of hacking not just to manipulate enemies into aiding your cause but also to bypass security systems, crack codes, and gain access to hidden areas vital to your mission. Utilize stealth tactics to slip past vigilant cybermage patrols and outmaneuver formidable obstacles undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/3facdbccc61bd09311ff86cc869814b3.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=139 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/53906cb445c8b8f4ec394be3dd1fbce6.poster.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/53906cb445c8b8f4ec394be3dd1fbce6.webm?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/53906cb445c8b8f4ec394be3dd1fbce6.mp4?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in versatile gameplay roles: become a relentless weapons specialist, a swift and lethal melee combatant, a shadowy ghost navigating unseen, or a skilled hacker unraveling digital puzzles.  <br><br>Fulfill your destiny as the ultimate guardian by guiding the prince to safety.  Mentor as you protect him to unlock his latent potential as a powerful warrior  and digital wizard that can be a true heir to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly detailed space station teeming with secrets, uncover the true motives of the cybermages, and restore peace to the kingdom in this unique and immersive gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/e1eb2618d753a01e61dc7ae363198d7f.poster.avif?t=1764170637\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/e1eb2618d753a01e61dc7ae363198d7f.webm?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/e1eb2618d753a01e61dc7ae363198d7f.mp4?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/545f6b924c6a5b1bfc3b18cef145a764.avif?t=1764170637\" width=856 height=188 /></span>You asked, we listened.<br>Angel Guardian now has full Twitch Chat Integration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your viewers don\u2019t just watch\u2014they play WITH you. By typing commands directly into your chat, they can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn enemies right in your path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop ammo when you\u2019re desperate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger Eiji\u2019s superpowers </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All commands show up in-game in real time\u2014share the IDs with your chat and let them unleash mayhem live while you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.poster.avif?t=1764170637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.webm?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.mp4?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/6f825a614d4761614063907eebcb210b.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=139 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 8 double-upgradeable rifles plus a sword. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the environmental hazards as weapons including gas and fire barrels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use stealth to sneak past enemies undetected. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help the prince maneuver through intense platforming action. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mentor the prince to unlock his cyber-magic abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Work together with the prince to learn simultaneous acrobatic combos and powerful attack moves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master hacking to get past doors and other digital locks before alarms bring enemies your way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle diverse enemies and devastating bosses </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather high-tech items like invisibility cloaks, shields or jet packs to help you escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/6393e2039bcb6e9f79d25ed102c3f7b8.avif?t=1764170637\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras_big/6393e2039bcb6e9f79d25ed102c3f7b8.webp?t=1764170637 width=1560 height=1099 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2508440?t=1764170637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764170637","caps