gh-tech or present-day weapons and double- upgrade them to unleash devastating firepower.  Alternatively, wield a trusty melee sword for up-close combat, slashing through enemies with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of hacking not just to manipulate enemies into aiding your cause but also to bypass security systems, crack codes, and gain access to hidden areas vital to your mission. Utilize stealth tactics to slip past vigilant cybermage patrols and outmaneuver formidable obstacles undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/3facdbccc61bd09311ff86cc869814b3.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=139 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/53906cb445c8b8f4ec394be3dd1fbce6.poster.avif?t=1764170637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/53906cb445c8b8f4ec394be3dd1fbce6.webm?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/53906cb445c8b8f4ec394be3dd1fbce6.mp4?t=1764170637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in versatile gameplay roles: become a relentless weapons specialist, a swift and lethal melee combatant, a shadowy ghost navigating unseen, or a skilled hacker unraveling digital puzzles.  <br><br>Fulfill your destiny as the ultimate guardian by guiding the prince to safety.  Mentor as you protect him to unlock his latent potential as a powerful warrior  and digital wizard that can be a true heir to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly